ont-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">고속도로장학재단을 설립 운영하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">년도 고속도로 장학금을 다음과 같이 지급코자 하오니 해당되시는 분은 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">다 음 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEI